      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## 08-18-06 automate safety inspections and corrective action follow up\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Inspectors fill a short form with status and notes for four safety areas.\n2. Invalid submissions alert the team on Telegram and by email.\n3. An AI agent turns every non-pass area into a corrective action with severity, owner and due date.\n4. Findings are logged to Google Sheets, and critical findings alert the team on Telegram and by email.\n5. A daily sweep reminds the team about overdue actions, and a Monday digest summarizes the week with an AI written update.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets, OpenAI, Gmail and Telegram credentials.\n- Use the included spreadsheet with the Inspections and CorrectiveActions tabs.\n- Share the form URL from the Safety Inspection Form node with your inspectors.\n- Change the inspection areas and the AI prompt to match your site.\n- The form appears at /form/safety/inspect on your n8n instance.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Edit the form areas, schedules, alert channels or the AI prompt to fit your routine."
      },
